# 行尾与二进制类型显式声明，避免不同机器上反复出现「LF will be replaced by CRLF」告警，
# 也避免 git 把图片、密钥库、jar 当文本做行尾转换而损坏它们。
* text=auto

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.jar binary
*.jks binary
*.keystore binary
*.ttf binary
*.ttc binary
*.woff2 binary

# Windows 脚本：保留 CRLF 更稳妥（PowerShell 两种都吃，但记事本打开更友好）
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# 预渲染产物与 SQL 不需要 diff 噪声
*.xml text
*.sql text
